<title>SINGAPORE: Super Coffeemix 1996 net up 104 pct.</title>
<headline>Super Coffeemix 1996 net up 104 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     11.01  vs    5.39</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	 10.00  vs   10.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)     5.50  vs    2.70</p>
<p>    Turnover		103.66  vs   62.06</p>
<p>    Other income	    0.73  vs    0.20</p>
<p>    Interest expense	0.47  vs    0.11</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.12  vs    1.27</p>
<p>    Minorities	    (2.10)  vs    0.28</p>
<p>Note - Super Coffeemix Manufacturing Ltd said a new flake cereal and a new soluble coffee plant recently constructed should place future growth on a better foundation. The Group expects to achieve satisfactory results this year.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8708080</p>
</text>
